Package: LilSpecUnmixR
Title: Free spectral unmixing and model diagnostics in R
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Yuchen", "Li", email= "yuchen.li@sydney.edu.au", role = c("aut", "cre")))
Description: This gives you an open-source way to perform spectral unmixing using reference control .fcs files and raw data .fcs files. 
    It then writes unmixed .fcs files that you can explore. 
    This also contains the metrics that help identify potential fluorophore unstability or interaction.
License: GPL (>= 3)
